        <h1>Write a Cover Letter, <em>Free to Download</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain guide to the cover letter: why so many free builders only let you download plain text unless you pay, what a strong letter actually contains, how to handle no experience, a career change, or a gap, and whether anyone still reads them. The Best Answer Hub Cover Letter Builder exports a real PDF and Word file, free.</p>
        <div class="byline"><span><b>Best Answer Hub</b></span><span>~10 min read</span><span>Free download</span><span>No signup</span></div>
