          <div class="seg b1">Write<small>guided, with live preview</small></div>
          <div class="seg b2">Download<small>real PDF and Word</small></div>
          <div class="seg b3">Free<small>no paywall, no watermark</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

