        <p class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-bae-border-light text-sm text-bae-muted">Jump into the tools: <a href="/tools/cover-letter-builder/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">Cover Letter Builder</a>, <a href="/tools/resume-builder/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">Resume Builder</a>, <a href="/tools/job-keyword-matcher/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">Job Keyword Matcher</a>, and <a href="/tools/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">all Tools</a>.</p>
